XenithOS
===========

Getting started
---------------

To get started with XenithOS, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source/manifest.com/setup/develop).

To initialize your local repository using the LineageOS trees, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/XenithOS/manifest.git -b lineage-23.0 --git-lfs
```
For shallow sync, you can use this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/XenithOS/manifest.git -b lineage-23.0 --git-lfs --depth=1
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync
```
Please see the [LineageOS Wiki](https://wiki.lineageos.org/) for building instructions, by device.

